  "bodyHash": "PMjv34ZJoEk=",
  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/logo.png\" alt=\"好友與對手\" width=\"836\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=%E8%AB%8B%E6%88%91%E5%96%9D%E6%9D%AF%E5%92%96%E5%95%A1&amp;color=5b9c51&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"請我喝杯咖啡\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=%E6%88%90%E7%82%BA%E8%B3%9C%E5%8A%A9%E8%80%85&amp;color=5b9c51&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;label=%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%E6%88%91%E5%80%91%E7%9A%84Discord&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我們的Discord\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=%E7%B6%AD%E5%9F%BA&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;color=5b9c51\" alt=\"維基\"> </a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">好友與對手新增了在生物投票中落選和被人遺忘的生物。其中一個主要目標是深入拓展原始概念，並為所有這些生物添加更多類似原版的特色。</p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">你可以查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a>以獲得已實現生物和功能的詳細概覽。</p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:33px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab.gif\" alt=\"螃蟹\" width=\"60\">&nbsp;&nbsp;螃蟹</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">介紹<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\">螃蟹</a>，一種友善的生物，出沒於紅樹林沼澤和海灘。想增加你的觸及範圍嗎？可以用蟹鉗來製作藥水，增加你的觸及範圍，為你的冒險提供寶貴的優勢。如果你想<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab#breeding\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁殖</a>這個小傢伙，你需要海帶和耐心，因為螃蟹需要把蛋「埋」在安全的地方。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcrab_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" alt=\"揮舞蟹鉗的螃蟹\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcrab_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" alt=\"螃蟹爬上紅樹林\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">其他與螃蟹相關的功能：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Craw-Claw\" rel=\"nofollow\">蟹鉗</a>物品</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Reaching\" rel=\"nofollow\">觸及</a>狀態效果</li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:41px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem.gif\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;凝灰岩傀儡</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem\" rel=\"nofollow\">凝灰岩傀儡</a>，一個雕像般的生物，可以持有並展示你給它的任何物品。但要小心，當它沒有睡覺時，它喜歡隨意散步。想讓你的凝灰岩傀儡待在原地？用<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#glueing\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂窩</a>把它固定住。如果你想<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#creation\" rel=\"nofollow\">建造</a>這個睡美人，你需要一個凝灰岩方塊、一個任意<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#dyeing\" rel=\"nofollow\">顏色</a>的羊毛方塊和一個南瓜。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ftuff_golem_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" alt=\"拿著附魔書的凝灰岩傀儡\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ftuff_golem_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" alt=\"睡著的凝灰岩傀儡\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal.gif\" alt=\"小淘氣\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;小淘氣</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">發現<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Rascal\" rel=\"nofollow\">小淘氣</a>，一種存在於礦井中的調皮小生物，喜歡玩捉迷藏。它既好玩又有幫助，在你尋找它的時候會給你提示。找到它三次，它就會獎勵你夢寐以求的束口袋！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252frascal_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" alt=\"礦井裡的小淘氣\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252frascal_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" alt=\"小淘氣扔出束口袋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem.gif\" alt=\"銅傀儡\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;銅傀儡</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">認識<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem\" rel=\"nofollow\">銅傀儡</a>，一個口袋大小的喜劇奇蹟，喜歡隨機按下銅按鈕。像其他銅製品一樣，隨著時間它會<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#oxidation\" rel=\"nofollow\">氧化</a>，但別擔心，維護很簡單！如果想快速翻新，拿<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#scraping\" rel=\"nofollow\">斧頭</a>或<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#waxing\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂窩</a>來處理。如果你想<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#creation\" rel=\"nofollow\">建造</a>這個小生物，你需要一個銅方塊、一個南瓜和一個避雷針。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcopper_golem_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" alt=\"村莊中的銅傀儡工作站結構\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcopper_golem_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" alt=\"銅傀儡們\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">其他與銅傀儡相關的功能：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem-Workstation\" rel=\"nofollow\">銅傀儡工作站</a>村莊結構</li>\n<li>所有銅變種的<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Button\" rel=\"nofollow\">銅按鈕</a></li>\n<li>所有銅變種的<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Lightning-Rod\" rel=\"nofollow\">避雷針</a></li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare.webp\" alt=\"發怒精靈\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;發怒精靈</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">介紹<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare\" rel=\"nofollow\">發怒精靈</a>，一種住在蒼鬱洞穴裡的脾氣暴躁又可愛的苔蘚夥伴，厭惡黑暗。你也討厭黑暗嗎？如果是這樣，發怒精靈可以為你顯示足以生成怪物的黑暗區域。如果你想<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#taming\" rel=\"nofollow\">馴服</a>或<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#breeding\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁殖</a>這個小可愛，你需要螢光莓，但要小心，發怒精靈經常拿它們當點心吃，不會留下任何殘渣。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fglare_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" alt=\"幼年和成年發怒精靈\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fglare_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" alt=\"在蒼鬱洞穴中飛行的發怒精靈\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer.webp\" alt=\"冰術師\" width=\"25\">&nbsp;&nbsp;冰術師</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">遭遇<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰術師</a>，一個孤獨的窳民，住在深雪之中。你可以透過在樹林中搜尋一個小型的雲杉<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">小屋</a>來找到他。但在冒險途中要小心，因為多年來在野外的生活使他的心變得比周圍的冰還要寒冷。如果他發現你，準備迎接<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰霜攻擊</a>，讓你的冒險變成冰冷的挑戰。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ficeologer_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" alt=\"雪地中的冰術師小屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ficeologer_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" alt=\"冰術師攻擊村民\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">其他與冰術師相關的功能：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰術師小屋</a>結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Freezing\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰凍圖騰</a>物品</li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom.webp\" alt=\"哞花\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;哞花</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">呈現<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\" rel=\"nofollow\">哞花</a>，一頭沐浴在陽光下的牛，身上覆蓋著美麗的花朵，主要生活在花朵森林中。這些身披花朵的夥伴不僅賞心悅目，還與蜜蜂形成了和諧的共生關係。當哞花走動時，會留下一條盛開的花徑，將每一步都轉變為穿越自然奇蹟的迷人旅程。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmoobloom_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" alt=\"金鳳花哞花\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmoobloom_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" alt=\"花卉哞花\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">與哞花相關的其他特性：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Buttercup\" rel=\"nofollow\">金鳳花</a> 花朵</li>\n<li>所有木材種類的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beehives\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂箱</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper-Area\" rel=\"nofollow\">養蜂場</a> 村莊結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" rel=\"nofollow\">養蜂人</a> 村民職業</li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire.webp\" alt=\"野火\" width=\"50\">&nbsp;&nbsp;野火</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire\" rel=\"nofollow\">野火</a>，烈焰人的主宰者，受到四面盾牌的保護。這場遭遇戰絕非友善之舉，小心它的盾牌碎片彈幕和震地衝擊波攻擊。當走投無路時，它會召喚烈焰人作為增援。征服這場挑戰，運用策略對抗這個位於其 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">要塞</a> 領域的火焰守護者。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fwildfire_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" alt=\"地獄中的要塞結構\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fwildfire_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" alt=\"要塞中的野火\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">與野火相關的其他特性：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">要塞</a> 結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown\" rel=\"nofollow\">野火皇冠</a> 物品</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown-Fragment\" rel=\"nofollow\">野火皇冠碎片</a> 物品</li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler.webp\" alt=\"吞噬獸\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;吞噬獸（無盡飢餓）</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)\" rel=\"nofollow\">吞噬獸</a>，一種在稀樹草原、惡地與沙漠中漫遊的小型掠食者。牠們會追獵雞、兔等生物。你可以餵食牠們附魔物品來 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)#storing-and-extracting-experience-points\" rel=\"nofollow\">儲存經驗值</a>，之後再用玻璃瓶提取出來。但請注意，經驗值越多，吞噬獸就會變得越大越飢餓！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmauler_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" alt=\"吞噬獸狩獵雞\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmauler_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" alt=\"被餵食的吞噬獸\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner.webp\" alt=\"幻術師\" width=\"25\">&nbsp;&nbsp;幻術師</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">遭遇 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻術師</a>，一個居住在針葉林中的狡猾弓箭手。你可以尋找小型小屋或訓練場來找到他。接近時請小心，因為 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#casting-blindness\" rel=\"nofollow\">致盲法術</a> 可能讓你陷入黑暗，難以分辨 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#summoning-illusions\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻影</a> 與現實。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fillusioner_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" alt=\"針葉林中的幻術師小屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fillusioner_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" alt=\"訓練場中的幻術師\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">與幻術師相關的其他特性：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner-Shack\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻術師小屋</a> 結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Illusion\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻象圖騰</a> 物品</li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse.webp\" alt=\"殭屍馬（陷阱）\" width=\"50\">&nbsp;&nbsp;殭屍馬（陷阱）</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">曾經想騎乘 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Zombie-Horse-(Trap)\" rel=\"nofollow\">殭屍馬</a> 嗎？如果是的話，在雷雨天氣時靠近一匹，魔法就可能發生——你甚至有機會一睹四騎士的風采。」</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fzombie_horse_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" alt=\"雷雨中的殭屍馬\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fzombie_horse_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" alt=\"雷雨中的四騎士\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">⚙️ 相容性 / 附加组件</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">Friends&amp;Foes 設計為與所有其他模組完全相容，目前提供數個附加組件和資料包：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - 花卉哞花</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - 養蜂人小屋</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">改造結構 - Friends and Foes 相容資料包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ctov-friends-and-foes-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">CTOV - Friends and Foes 相容資料包</a></li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">💬 社群</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 Discord 伺服器社群</a>，聊天、分享你的創作、提出任何問題，或只是獲取模組最新開發動態，並在新版本發布時獲得通知。也請不要猶豫，<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">透過 GitHub Issues 回報任何崩潰或錯誤</a>。</p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">👋 支持</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">我會繼續將開發模組作為一項愛好，因為我真的很享受這個過程。如果你想支持我，可以在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a> 上進行。非常感謝你的支持。</p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">📜 授權條款</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組採用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252fLICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 授權。</p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎自由查閱我的程式碼，了解我在開發此模組時如何解決各種挑戰。你可以將程式碼片段整合到自己的專案中。也歡迎在任何模組包中使用此模組（若能標示來源並附上此頁面連結，將不勝感激）。</p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">你也可以查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/blockbench\" rel=\"nofollow\">blockbench 目錄</a>，其中包含所有模型與調色盤，以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/friendsandfoes/textures\" rel=\"nofollow\">材質目錄</a> 中的紋理。歡迎從中汲取靈感，但請不要直接複製貼上當作自己的作品。</p>",
